flowchart TD
 A[Customer submits payment] --> B[Create transaction reference]
 B --> C[Retrieve authoritative payment status]
 C --> D[Display Processing / Pending]
 D --> E{Success confirmed?}
 E -- Yes --> F[Display Transaction successful]
 F --> G[Make proof of payment available]
 E -- No --> H{Failed or unresolved?}
 H -- Failed --> I[Display Failed and safe next step]
 H -- Unresolved --> J[Create Payments Operations case with owner]
 J --> K[Notify customer and track progress]
 K --> L[Investigate and resolve]
 L --> M[Return / release funds where applicable]
 M --> N[Notify customer and close case]
